description: Database schema and SQL migration conventions
globs: src/database/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Migrations

- Schema source of truth for types: `src/database/schema.ts` (Drizzle).
- Apply changes with a **new** `.sql` file in `src/database/migrations/` via `npm run generate <name>`.
- Run `npm run migrate` to apply; never edit already-applied migration files.
- `scripts/migrate.js` is the runner only — do not put schema DDL there.
- Do not use Drizzle Kit push/generate unless the user explicitly requests a workflow change.
